  \item Controlled-study gains \(\neq\) bedside impact.
  \item Implementation gap \(\rightarrow\) safety and trust risk.
\end{itemize}
\vspace{2mm}
\colorbox{accent!20}{\parbox{0.95\linewidth}{\textbf{Core message:} Evidence supports accuracy gains, but translation is the bottleneck.}}
}

\posterbox[highlightcard,title={Recommendations \& Future Directions}]
  {name=recs,column=1,between=row12 and row18}
{
\begin{enumerate}
  \item Mandate prospective, multisite validation.
  \item Require demographic-stratified reporting.
  \item Establish AI safety-event registries.
  \item Invest in interoperable data standards.
  \item Prioritise explainability for trust.
\end{enumerate}
}

\posterbox[darkcard,title={Key Numbers (Context)}]
  {name=context,column=1,between=row18 and bottom}
{
\begin{itemize}
