  \item \textbf{692} FDA-cleared AI/ML medical devices (2023).
\end{itemize}
\vspace{2mm}
{\fontsize{28}{34}\selectfont\color{textgray}
Numbers summarise the evidence base described in the accompanying brief.}
}

